## Question

Which staleness/maintenance state is shared through git and which stays per-clone?
Today a fresh clone starts blind, and the same doc reads fresh on one machine and
expired on another. Constraint from the map Notes: anything shared through git is
written only by a deliberate, human-gated step — never by automation or hooks.

